An empty file of every supported extension prints only its path and `(0 lines)`: no header, no
outline lines, and no blank line of its own beyond the one that separates files.
== args
input/empty.md
input/empty.ts
input/empty.tsx
input/empty.js
input/empty.rs
input/empty.css
input/empty.json
input/empty.toml
input/empty.yaml
== file input/empty.md
== file input/empty.ts
== file input/empty.tsx
== file input/empty.js
== file input/empty.rs
== file input/empty.css
== file input/empty.json
== file input/empty.toml
== file input/empty.yaml
